output with all the key components for each experiment—name, plan ID, description, expected results with detailed metrics, rationale for those specific values, which tables they'll populate, figure descriptions, and analysis of what this means for the paper's narrative. I'm also thinking through additional metrics beyond the main ones, like code contamination rates and feature importance scores that would strengthen the universality claims.\n\nWriting the YAML... So the theoretical decomposition holds up — oracle two-stage performance nearly matches within-strategy performance, confirming the framework's validity, but strategy identification is where things break down in practice, explaining the gap between predicted and naive results. For EMNLP, I'm positioning this as a \"New Missions\" paper that introduces the task formalization and comprehensive Atlas framework with evidence of scale and mode robustness, highlighting the open challenges we've uncovered. Looking at the component ablation experiments, the DCOL v6 analysis is cancelled since the initial tests already showed negative results, so there's no point running the full ablation. The fundamental issue is that RoBERTa's [CLS] token captures semantic content rather than depth ordering signals, so no single component ablation can overcome this representation bottleneck. Removing attractive forces causes embedding collapse, removing repulsive forces eliminates ordinal structure entirely, and dropping the margin schedule doesn't help representation quality—all variants suffer from severe overfitting because the model learns surface patterns from the training set rather than generalizable depth signals.\n\nI'm deciding to drop the ablation study since DCOL's negative results already demonstrate the inherent limitations of contrastive ordinal learning for text-based depth estimation, which strengthens the paper's narrative by pivoting toward feature-based methods and Atlas as the core contribution. Now I'm validating the 13B model performance in clean FP16 precision. Looking at the performance metrics across the depth classes, the random forest achieves 57% accuracy on the three-class problem with strong discrimination between d0 and other depths (AUC 0.97-0.99), but struggles more with distinguishing d1 from d2 (AUC 0.76). The per-class analysis shows d0 has excellent recall and precision around 0.88-0.96, while d2 is the most challenging with only 0.42 recall despite reasonable precision, and the sensitivity metric for the EDD test at T_080 reaches perfect detection.\n\nThe top predictive features are perplexity-based metrics—p90_ppl ranks first, followed by mean_ppl and variance of surprisal—with p90_ppl consistently appearing in the top 2 features. The finetuning losses decrease substantially across depths (1.80 down to 0.88), and code contamination increases with depth from 0.3% at d0 to 2.8% at d3.\n\nNow looking at the comparative analysis: the 14B model achieves 67% accuracy on the 4-class task versus the 1B baseline's ~80%, a 13 percentage point drop. This suggests the larger model's smoother loss landscape means LoRA finetuning causes less distributional shift—the generated text at d1 stays closer to the original d0 quality, compressing the perplexity differences across depths.\n\nFor the d1v2 AUC metric, we see 0.76 on 14B versus 1B's ~0.88, another ~12pp decline. The feature space displacement from d1→d2 transitions is smaller because the 14B model's larger capacity absorbs training data changes without dramatically altering generation behavior. Finally, the 14B model reaches convergence to an attractor distribution in just 2 steps at T=0.75, whereas the 1B model requires 3-4 recursive iterations to become indistinguishable. 14B 在 2 次后就已接近。这与 model collapse 理论一致——更大模型的 attractor basin 更宽、收敛更快。d2v3 AUC=0.70 恰好在 T=0.75 阈值以下，说明 depth 2 和 depth 3 在 14B 上已经非常接近。\n\np90_ppl 保持 top-2 但 var_surprisal 可能跌至 rank 3：p90_ppl 捕获极端 token 的 perplexity，这个信号在 14B 上仍然存在——即使整体质量提高，极端 token 的 perplexity 分布仍会随递归深度变化。但 var_surprisal 的区分力减弱，因为 14B 生成的文本在 surprisal 方差上天然更稳定，depth 间差异被压缩。mean_ppl 可能上升到 rank 2 因为它在绝对尺度上对 14B 的 quality shift 更敏感。\n\nFinetune loss 下降更快——14B 在原始数据上的 loss 就更低，fine-tune convergence 更快，递归间的 loss gap 也更小。\n\n这进一步证实 distributional shift 被压缩。\n\nPythia-410M reference model 对 14B 输出的区分力下降：14B 生成文本的 perplexity distribution 更接近 real text，因为 14B 本身就是更好的 language model。但 relative depth ordering 仍可检测——递归仍然系统性地改变 distributional properties。现在我需要查看这些对比表格来验证 1B 和 14B 的精度、AUC 和特征重要性排名的差异。\n\n我在准备几个关键的可视化：AUC 衰减曲线显示 14B 在 d1v2 处的急剧下降，混淆矩阵对比 14B 和最佳 1B 模型的分类错误，以及特征重要性排名的位移——特别是 var_surprisal 从第二位下降到第三位。这些结果直接支持 median 的分析。\n\n现在我在调整叙事框架：信号确实在衰减但仍然存在，67% 的准确率远超随机猜测的 25%，所以这不是完全失效，只是不再\"跨规模稳健\"。EDD 从 3-4 降至 2 是最重要的新发现——这引入了规模依赖的 EDD 概念，把它从静态边界升级为条件边界。对第一个主张加上限定词，改为\"在 1-1.5B 时信号持续存在，到 14B 时衰减约 13 个百分点\"，标题改为\"1-1.5B 时 70-85%；14B 时 62-72%\"。对于 Atlas 的第二个主张，14B 的数据点扩展了它的规模维度。\n\n9 格矩阵（3 个模型 × 3 个策略）仍是核心，14B 是规模扩展面板，而 EDD 的规模依赖性是新发现。针对评审者关于\"仅限小模型\"的担忧，我直接回应——14B 的干净 FP16 数据确认了信号存在，衰减程度量化为约 13 个百分点，不是消失。接下来还有一个计划是在 RedPajama 和 Dolma 语料上校准深度分类器，评估野生数据的假正率和跨语料库一致性，但这已推迟到 AAAI 的投稿窗口。\n\n现在我在查看这两个语料库上的分类器表现——RedPajama 和 Dolma 都各有 5000 个段落，分别显示出不同的深度分布和假正率，Dolma 的维基百科子集表现特别好。\n\n跨语料库的一致性分析显示，RedPajama 和 C4 之间的假正率差异很小，这是合理的，因为它们都基于 Common Crawl，而 Dolma 与 FineWeb 之间的差异更大，反映出模板和 SEO 内容在所有网络爬虫语料库中的一致性标记模式。\n\nDolma 的假正率约 15%，低于纯网络爬虫数据集，因为它混合了高质量来源（如 Wikipedia 和学术论文，假正率接近 0%）和网络爬虫组分（假正率约 20%），加权后得出这个中间值。\n\n跨语料库的一致性很强——四个数据集都显示假正率由内容质量驱动，与具体数据集无关，所以 RedPajama 和 Dolma 应该遵循这个规律。我正在整理六个语料库的假正率对比表和按数据质量分层的柱状图来展示这个模式。\n\n这个实验可以延后，不会影响 EMNLP 投稿，因为现有的四个数据点已经足够支撑论点，后续可以把 RedPajama 和 Dolma 的结果作为扩展分析放入 AAAI 版本。\n\n接下来要验证用主题提示前缀替代无条件生成时，深度信号是否仍然成立。\n\n我在看预期的分类性能指标——随机森林和逻辑回归在四分类和三分类任务上的准确率，以及各深度等级之间的配对 AUC 值。\n\n现在还在查看每个类别的召回率、精确率和 F1 分数的细节，以及模型相比基线的保留率百分比。\n\n接下来看到的是与 BOS 基线的对比，显示四分类准确率下降了 16.3 个百分点，D1 vs D2 的 AUC 也有所下降。最重要的特征是困惑度相关的指标，特别是 p90 困惑度、困惑度方差和 p75 困惑度，这些特征的重要性比例都在 0.78 到 0.85 之间。\n\n同时我看到微调损失随深度递减，代码污染率随深度增加而上升，这表明主题种子通过引入内容先验限制了模型的生成范围，压缩了不同深度间的统计变异。\n\n但关键是80%的保留率说明信号主要来自token级别的分布偏移而非主题多样性——递归微调改变的是模型的概率分布，这种变化在提示约束下仍然发生，因为提示只限制了\"说什么\"而不限制模型的内部表示。\n\n在有主题提示的情况下，d1到d2的分布偏移被进一步压缩，AUC从0.913下降到0.76，说明主题提示充当了正则化器，使微调后的模型在生成相关内容时更接近原始模型的行为，降低了特征空间的分离度。不过AUC仍然超过0.65，表明信号依然存在。特征排序保持不变，困惑度的尾部统计仍然是最强的指标。\n\n虽然主题约束无法完全消除尾部效应，但重要性权重整体下降15-22%，与准确率下降一致。在T=0.75时EDD=2，与13B实验结果一致，但这次是由于主题约束压缩了特征空间中的深度信号幅度，而非模型容量导致的快速收敛。\n\n提示模式下d2和d3变得难以区分，微调损失显示提示d0文本更结构化，模型学习更容易，但这个优势在递归中保持，所以深度间的损失差距仍然存在。代码污染极低（<2%），因为主题种子生成以自然语言主题为约束，几乎不产生代码片段。\n\n现在我在整理表格和图表来对比BOS和提示模式的性能指标——包括准确率、AUC、保留率，以及按类别的召回率、精确率和F1分数，还有特征重要性排名。我用配对柱状图展示各项指标的对比，用特征轨迹面板显示前5个特征在不同深度的衰减模式。\n\n提示实验是中位数叙事的关键支柱，信号保留但衰减，80%的保留率足以称为\"部分生态学验证\"——不是伪影，但也不是完全稳健。\n\n现在我需要更新论文叙事，在声明中加入提示生成下准确率保留约80%基线的内容，这证实深度信号不是无条件生成的伪影，而是反映递归微调的真实分布变化；在局限性中坦诚报告16个百分点的衰减，并指出更多样化的提示策略或更长的生成可能恢复准确率是未来工作。我不能再说信号在BOS和提示下相同，但可以说是相同的底层信号只是信噪比不同。对于审稿人关于\"BOS伪影\"的担忧，我直接用67% > 25%（随机）来回应，证实信号存在，但需要诚实报告16个百分点的差距。\n\n接下来我在规划两阶段管道方案：先用19个特征训练策略识别分类器进行三分类，再用策略条件深度分类器，将59.1%的跨策略准确率转化为可实际部署的方案。现在我在查看各模型的性能指标——Pythia、OLMo和GPT2-XL在策略分类上的准确率和各采样策略的召回率。\n\n我注意到nucleus和topk50采样策略最容易互相混淆，而temp09虽然相对可区分但召回率仍然较低。在深度估计方面，我对比了跨策略留一法验证的基准（59.1%）与两阶段预测方案和朴素池化方案的性能提升，以及预言机两阶段方案的上界表现。\n\n关键的性能差距显示，预测方案相比朴素池化方案反而下降了1.4个百分点，但与预言机方案相比仍有7.8个百分点的差距。我现在理解到策略分类只达到57.5%的准确率，远低于预期的90%，主要原因是这19个统计特征主要编码的是深度信号而非策略信号——p90困惑度和惊异度方差的值主要由深度决定，策略的影响是二阶效应，导致三种采样策略在特征空间中的分布严重重叠。\n\n具体来看，nucleus和topk都是基于截断的采样方法，特征分布高度相似，只有temperature缩放产生明显差异，但这种区分力主要集中在浅层和中层的边界附近，在更深的层级处三种策略的特征值又趋于收敛。相比之下，GPT-2 XL在策略分类上表现最好，达到65.4%，这反映出该模型对temperature变化的敏感性最强。\n\n而Pythia表现最差，因为三种策略在该模型上产生的特征分布最为接近。\n\n最关键的是Oracle两阶段分类器（78.4%）与同策略内分类（78.2%）几乎相同，这验证了当策略已知时，模型能够完美恢复性能，两者的差距在统计误差范围内。这说明跨策略准确率的下降完全源于策略不匹配，而非其他混淆因素。相比之下，预测两阶段分类器（70.6%）的性能则低于简单池化方法。\n\n策略分类器57.5%的错误率意味着约42.5%的样本被错误地路由到不匹配的分类器，这种错误路由的损害超过了正确路由带来的收益。简单池化方法通过在全部训练数据上拟合单个随机森林来平均化策略差异，反而更加稳定。只有当策略分类准确率超过约65%时，预测两阶段方法才能超越简单池化。简单池化（72.0%）相比跨策略留一法（59.1%）提升了12.9个百分点，因为它避免了策略分类这一步骤。\n\n现在我看到了几个关键表格和图表——策略分类准确率、深度估计准确率的阶梯（从留一法的59.1%到预测两阶段的70.6%再到oracle两阶段的78.4%），以及策略混淆矩阵。\n\n这些结果重新定义了第三个主张：不是完全解决了部署挑战，而是验证了理论分解的正确性，同时识别出了实际瓶颈——策略识别才是关键限制，因为这19个特征主要编码的是深度而非策略本身。\n\n实际上朴素池化达到72%已经是很强的实用贡献，相比交叉验证的59.1%有显著提升，这表明策略无关的池化方法本身就很有效，而两阶段方法只有在策略分类准确率超过65-70%时才能超越它。这个框架——验证原理加识别瓶颈加明确开放问题——对EMNLP来说比简单的\"已解决\"更有科学价值。 我注意到实际结果都落在中位数范围内——策略分类器准确率0.575在[0.57, 0.65]范围内，两阶段预测准确率0.706在[0.68, 0.73]范围内，预言机与内部差距0.2pp在[0, 3]范围内。这表明中位数层级的定义实际上已经包含了这些已知结果，所以我应该用这些中位数值作为预测。\n\n现在我需要检查用户要求的每条预测都有result_rationale，并验证我的提示实验预测在内部是否一致——特别是Plan_016使用GPT-2 XL nucleus，我需要对比plan_003的基线结果来确保我的预测合理。\n\n我的保留率都在80-83%范围内，这对最强模型来说是合理的。现在检查微调损失值，我预测的值应该略低于BOS基线，这反映了提示的改进效果。 different because the d0 data is topic-seeded (more structured). The d0 loss might be lower (easier to learn) but let me reconsider.\n\nActually, the d0 loss in the prompted case depends on what d0 data is. If d0 is GPT-2 XL generated text with topic prompts, then fine-tuning on this data means the model is learning to reproduce its own prompted output. This should have a similar loss to BOS d0 fine-tuning (learning to reproduce BOS output). Actually, d0 fine-tune loss depends on the entropy of d0 text. Topic-seeded text may have lower entropy (more constrained) → slightly lower loss.\n\nLet me adjust: d0=2.35 (slightly lower than BOS 2.55 because prompted text is more constrained and predictable).\n\nActually, wait. In the BOS experiments, d0 finetune loss is the loss of fine-tuning the base model on the original training data (human text). For GPT-2 XL, the base model was originally trained on WebText, so fine-tuning on WebText gives loss ~2.55.\n\nFor prompted experiments, d0 is GPT-2 XL's own output with topic prompts. Fine-tuning on its own generated text should yield a lower loss since the model is already well-suited to that distribution—probably around 2.20. Then d1 fine-tuning on the d0-fine-tuned model's output would be even lower, maybe 1.50, since the topic-constrained text becomes increasingly predictable at each iteration.\n\nThe depth gaps compress slightly in prompted mode compared to BOS, which aligns with the attenuated signal hypothesis. Let me settle on d0=2.30, d1=1.55, d2=1.20 to show the same monotonic decrease with shrinking gaps.\n\nNow I'm finalizing the YAML, but I need to decide whether to include the d0 finetune loss. Looking at the experimental data, some runs report finetune losses starting from depth_0 while others start from depth_1, so I need to check what's actually available and consistent across the experiments.\n\nI'm settling on a final structure: plan_010 gets a brief entry since it's cancelled, plan_014 and plan_016 get detailed treatment as the main validation and generation experiments, plan_015 is deferred with moderate detail, and plan_017 rounds out the two-stage pipeline work.\n\nNow I'm writing out the full YAML with careful attention to the result_rationale fields—I want each one to explain the underlying mechanism rather than just repeating the numbers. I'm also accounting for how Qwen2.5-14B's larger scale affects the fine-tuning losses compared to the 1B baseline models, since a 14B model's superior language modeling capability means its training loss on d0 data should be noticeably lower than what we'd see with smaller models.\n\nBut I need to be careful here—different tokenizers across model families make absolute loss values incomparable, so I'm focusing instead on the relative gaps between depth levels. Looking at the projected losses for Qwen2.5-14B, the gaps between d0→d1→d2 are compressed compared to typical 1B patterns, which aligns with what we'd expect from a more capable base model.\n\nNow for the feature importance analysis on plan_014, I'm reconsidering how perplexity behaves when Pythia-410M evaluates Qwen2.5-14B's output. The 14B model produces higher quality text closer to human distributions, so its perplexity under the Pythia reference should fall somewhere between d0 human text and lower-quality model outputs.\n\nThis compression of the feature gap at larger scales is exactly why accuracy drops—the reference model struggles to distinguish between depths when the distributions converge. The p90_ppl metric still captures surprising tokens that persist through recursive fine-tuning, though the signal weakens, while variance in surprisal continues to differentiate across tokens despite the overall perplexity convergence.\n\nNow I'm verifying the numerical predictions against the actual gaps to make sure everything checks out before finalizing the results.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48990,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48990},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c7101da4-5ca2-44c8-a3d5-cc2170f848fb","uuid":"5bb8208c-6918-4166-a93f-a3df0f0a8b0b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AvnbxZyoT9AFamVsiZFSYQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 1: 条件性断言 — \"depth estimation is feasible and accurate at 1–1.5B (70–85%);\n  the signal persists at 14B (~67%) with ~13pp attenuation, and under prompted generation\n  (~67%) with ~16pp attenuation, indicating scale- and mode-dependent signal reduction\n  that warrants further investigation.\" Headline: \"70–85% at 1–1.5B; signal persists\n  at 14B (62–72%) and under topic-seeded generation (58–70%).\"\n\n  Claim 2: Atlas 9-cell 核心不变。14B 数据点扩展 scale 维度，EDD 从 1B 的 3–4 降至 14B\n  的 2（T=0.75），引入 scale-dependent EDD 概念——更大模型更快收敛到 attractor distribution。\n\n  Claim 3: 完全 reframe — \"we validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle\n  two-stage (78.4%) recovers within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming strategy\n  conditioning as the theoretically correct approach. Strategy identification from depth\n  features alone is the practical bottleneck (57.5%), and naive multi-strategy pooling\n  (72.0%) serves as a strong zero-cost baseline improving from 59.1%.\"\n\n  EMNLP Main: \"New Missions\" track — task formalization + comprehensive Atlas + scale/mode\n  robustness evidence (both positive AND honest attenuation reporting) + identified open\n  challenges (strategy identification, prompted SNR, scale-dependent EDD).\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"DCOL Component Ablation (Cancelled)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      DCOL v6 各组件消融（attractive loss / repulsive loss / margin schedule / embedding\n      pooling）。前置依赖 plan_004 结论为 negative（test 64.5% vs RF 78.2%），实验取消。\n    expected_results:\n      status: cancelled\n      reason: \"plan_004 (DCOL v6) negative — test_acc=64.5%, severe overfitting, 前置条件不满足\"\n      hypothetical_if_run:\n        attractive_only_acc: 0.58\n        repulsive_only_acc: 0.52\n        no_margin_schedule_acc: 0.61\n        full_model_acc: 0.645\n        best_ablation_vs_rf_gap_pp: -12\n        all_variants_overfit: true\n    result_rationale: |\n      DCOL 的根本失败是 representation bottleneck：RoBERTa-large [CLS] embedding 编码语义\n      内容而非 distributional depth signal。消融任一组件不改变此限制。attractive-only 去除\n      inter-class repulsion → embedding collapse（v1-v3 已验证此模式）；repulsive-only 丧失\n      ordinal structure → 退化为普通多类对比；no-margin-schedule 移除课程学习但 representation\n      quality 不变。所有变体均会在 train 75% vs val ~60-64% 处表现出严重过拟合——模型学到\n      training set 表面模式而非 generalizable depth signal。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      取消不影响论文。DCOL v6 negative result 纳入 Discussion 作为 \"contrastive ordinal\n      learning on text depth estimation 的固有局限\" 分析，增加论文诚实度。消融细节不需要。\n\n  - name: \"13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA（无量化），nucleus p=0.95，d0-d3 递归链，19 特征提取 +\n      RF/LR 分类。Pythia-410M 作为 reference model。验证 depth signal 在主流规模是否持续。\n    expected_results:\n      data:\n        model: Qwen2.5-14B\n        precision: FP16\n        quantization: none\n        strategy: nucleus_p095\n        depths: 4\n        samples_per_depth: 5000\n        reference_model: Pythia-410M\n        feature_dim: 19\n        truncation_length: 498\n      four_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.67\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.655, 0.685]\n        lr_accuracy: 0.63\n        lr_accuracy_ci: [0.614, 0.646]\n        mae: 0.38\n      pairwise_auc:\n        d0v1: 0.97\n        d0v2: 0.985\n        d0v3: 0.99\n        d1v2: 0.76\n        d1v3: 0.92\n        d2v3: 0.70\n      three_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.57\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.552, 0.588]\n        auc:\n          d1v2: 0.75\n          d1v3: 0.91\n          d2v3: 0.69\n      per_class:\n        d0: { recall: 0.96, precision: 0.88, f1: 0.92 }\n        d1: { recall: 0.68, precision: 0.62, f1: 0.65 }\n        d2: { recall: 0.42, precision: 0.52, f1: 0.46 }\n        d3: { recall: 0.62, precision: 0.70, f1: 0.66 }\n      edd_sensitivity:\n        T_080: 1   # d1v2=0.76<0.80 → FAIL\n        T_075: 2   # d1v2=0.76≥0.75 PASS, d2v3=0.70<0.75 FAIL\n        T_070: 3   # d2v3=0.70≥0.70 PASS, 4-depth data caps at 3\n        T_065: 3   # d2v3=0.70≥0.65 PASS\n      top_features:\n        rank_1: p90_ppl\n        rank_2: mean_ppl       # 从 1B 的 rank 3-5 上升\n        rank_3: var_surprisal  # 从 1B 的 rank 1-2 下降\n        rank_4: p75_ppl\n        rank_5: mean_surprisal\n      feature_universality:\n        p90_ppl_in_top2: true\n        var_surprisal_in_top2: false\n        var_surprisal_in_top4: true\n        both_in_top5: true\n      finetune_losses:\n        depth_0: 1.65\n        depth_1: 1.15\n        depth_2: 0.90\n      code_contamination:\n        d0: 0.003\n        d1: 0.015\n        d2: 0.022\n        d3: 0.028\n      scale_comparison:\n        vs_1b_mean_nucleus_acc_delta_pp: -13.1\n        vs_1b_mean_d1v2_auc_delta: -0.12\n        vs_1b_edd_delta: \"-2 (from 3-4 to 2 at T=0.75)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **4-class 67% (1B mean ~80%, Δ=-13pp)**:\n      14B 语言建模能力远超 1B，每次递归 fine-tune 产生的 distributional shift 更小。\n      14B 模型的 loss landscape 更平滑——同等 LoRA rank 的参数扰动对 14B output 分布的\n      影响被 14B 的大参数量\"稀释\"。结果是 d1 文本的 statistical properties 更接近 d0，\n      d1/d2/d3 在 feature space 中更紧凑。67% 仍远超 chance (25%)——信号存在但被压缩。\n\n      **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (1B mean ~0.88, Δ=-0.12)**:\n      d1→d2 是最关键的难点对。14B 模型在 d1 数据上 fine-tune 时，大容量让模型能\"吸收\"\n      训练数据变化而不显著改变生成行为——14B 有足够参数分配给 d1 分布的细微特征，同时保持\n      整体生成质量不变。这压缩了 d1/d2 feature space 间距。但 AUC>0.70 说明 boundary\n      仍然存在，不是随机水平。\n\n      **EDD=2 at T=0.75 (1B EDD=3-4)**:\n      这是最重要的 scale finding。14B 加速收敛到 attractor distribution：1B 模型需 3-4\n      次递归才到不可区分边界，14B 仅需 2 次。机制：更大模型的 attractor basin 更宽且\n      收敛梯度更陡，每步递归消除更大比例的 non-attractor distributional structure。\n      d2v3 AUC=0.70 恰在 T=0.75 下方——d2 和 d3 在 14B 上已几乎不可区分。\n      T=0.70 时 EDD=3 提供了对 threshold sensitivity 的有效展示。\n\n      **var_surprisal 从 rank 1-2 降至 rank 3**:\n      14B 生成文本在 token-level surprisal 上天然更一致（低方差），depth 间的 variance\n      差异被压缩。相比之下，p90_ppl 保持 top-2——极端 token 的 perplexity 在递归中\n      仍有可检测变化，因为即使 14B 也有 tail tokens 受递归 fine-tune 影响。mean_ppl\n      上升到 rank 2 因为 14B 文本的整体 perplexity 水平对 depth 的敏感度相对增强——\n      当 variance signal 被压缩时，mean level 成为主要鉴别器。\n\n      **Finetune losses 更低且间距更小 (d0=1.65→d1=1.15→d2=0.90)**:\n      14B 在原始数据上 loss 就更低（更好的 language model），递归间 loss drop 也更小\n      (Δd0d1=-0.50 vs 1B typical -0.60~-0.85)。这直接证实 distributional shift 被压缩。\n\n      **Pythia reference model 区分力衰减**:\n      Pythia-410M 看到的 14B 各 depth 输出的 perplexity 分布更接近 d0（因为 14B 生成\n      质量全面更接近 human text），depth 间的 feature distance 在 Pythia 视角下被压缩。\n      但 relative ordering 保持——d0<d1<d2<d3 in p90_ppl 的单调趋势仍在，只是间距变窄。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Scale Comparison — 3 个 1B 模型 (nucleus) vs 14B 的 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, EDD\"\n      - \"Table: EDD Sensitivity — T=0.65/0.70/0.75/0.80 下的 EDD 值，1B (3 models) vs 14B\"\n      - \"Table: Feature Importance Ranking — 1B pooled vs 14B，标注 rank shift\"\n      - \"Table: Per-class Precision/Recall/F1 — 14B vs 1B best (GPT-2 XL nucleus)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: 3 条 1B 实线 + 1 条 14B 虚线。14B 线在 d1v2 处急剧下降，视觉化 scale-dependent attenuation。加 EDD threshold 横线 (T=0.75)。\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap pair: 14B (left) vs GPT-2 XL 1.5B (right)。14B 的 d1/d2 混淆区域显著扩大。\"\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart: grouped bars (1B mean vs 14B)，标注 var_surprisal rank shift (2→3) 和 mean_ppl rank shift (3-5→2)。\"\n    analysis: |\n      13B 结果是 median 叙事的核心支柱：signal persists with quantified attenuation。\n\n      对 Claim 1: \"at 1–1.5B, four-class accuracy reaches 70–85%; at 14B clean FP16,\n      accuracy is 67% (Δ≈−13pp), demonstrating that the depth signal persists at\n      mainstream model scale but with reduced discriminability.\" 不再说 \"robust across\n      scales\"，改为 \"signal persists with scale-dependent attenuation.\"\n\n      对 Claim 2 (Atlas): EDD scale-dependence (1B: 3-4, 14B: 2) 是独立 finding。\n      写入 Atlas section 作为 \"scale extension panel\"。EDD 公式从 EDD(M, S, T) 扩展为\n      EDD(M, S, T, |θ|)——depth boundary 是 model size 的函数。\n\n      对 Reviewer concern \"only tested on small models\": 直接回应——14B clean FP16\n      实验确认信号存在，衰减幅度精确量化。这比 \"signal disappears at scale\" 或\n      \"signal is identical at scale\" 都更 informative 且更诚实。\n\n      Feature universality claim 需限定: \"p90_ppl and var_surprisal consistently appear\n      in the top-5 across all settings including 14B, though their relative ranking\n      shifts at larger scale (var_surprisal drops from top-2 to top-4 at 14B).\"\n\n  - name: \"Wild-data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      在 RedPajama 和 Dolma 上运行已训练的 depth classifier，评估 FPR 和跨语料一致性。\n      已延后到 AAAI 窗口，不阻塞 EMNLP 投稿。\n    expected_results:\n      status: deferred_to_aaai\n      redpajama:\n        n_passages: 5000\n        d0_pct: 80.0\n        d1_pct: 15.2\n        d2_pct: 3.3\n        d3_pct: 1.5\n        fpr: 20.0\n        mean_p_d0: 0.78\n      dolma:\n        n_passages: 5000\n        d0_pct: 85.0\n        d1_pct: 11.0\n        d2_pct: 2.5\n        d3_pct: 1.5\n        fpr: 15.0\n        mean_p_d0: 0.82\n        per_source_fpr:\n          wiki_subset: 1.0\n          academic_subset: 3.0\n          books_subset: 2.0\n          web_subset: 20.0\n      cross_corpus_pattern:\n        editorial_fpr_range: \"0–3%\"\n        curated_web_fpr_range: \"12–18%\"\n        raw_webcrawl_fpr_range: \"18–22%\"\n        six_corpus_summary: \"FPR 由内容质量驱动，非 dataset-specific artifact\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **RedPajama FPR ~20%**: RedPajama-v2 与 C4 同为 Common Crawl 子集 + 质量过滤，数据\n      组成高度重叠。已有三个 web-crawl 数据集 FPR 一致 (C4=20.2%, FineWeb=19.5%,\n      RedPajama_sample≈20%)，表明 ~20% 是 web-crawl 内容中 template/SEO/boilerplate 的\n      固有比例——这些文本的高重复率和低词汇多样性使其 feature profile 酷似 d1+ 生成文本。\n\n      **Dolma FPR ~15%**: Dolma 由 AI2 策划，包含高质量子集（Wikipedia, books, academic\n      papers）和 web 子集。Wikipedia 类内容 FPR ≈ 0% (WikiText 验证), academic/books 约\n      2-3%，web 子集约 20%。混合后整体 ~15%，低于纯 web-crawl 但高于纯 editorial。\n\n      **Cross-corpus 一致性**: 4 个已有数据点已建立清晰模式——FPR 与数据质量强相关，与数据\n      来源弱相关。RedPajama/Dolma 不会打破此规律，只会增加模式的统计确信度。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): FPR across 6+ corpora — WikiText/OpenWebText/C4/FineWeb/RedPajama/Dolma，按质量层级排列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: FPR by corpus, 分三组 (editorial ≤3% / curated-web 12-18% / raw-web-crawl 18-22%)\"\n    analysis: |\n      延后不影响 EMNLP。当前 4 个数据点 (WikiText 0% / OpenWebText ~1-3% / C4 ~20% /\n      FineWeb ~19.5%) 已足够支撑 \"FPR is content-quality-driven\" 论述。\n      RedPajama/Dolma 增加密度但不改变结论。AAAI 版本可加入作为 extended analysis。\n\n  - name: \"Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-2 XL topic-seeded d0-d3 递归链。用 ~10 个 topic prompt 前缀替代 BOS 无条件生成，\n      验证 depth signal 是否为无条件生成的 artifact。d0 = base GPT-2 XL 有 prompt 生成，\n      d1-d3 = 递归 LoRA fine-tune 后有 prompt 生成。Pythia-410M 为 reference model。\n    expected_results:\n      data:\n        model: GPT-2 XL (1.5B)\n        strategy: nucleus_p095\n        generation_mode: topic-seeded\n        prompt_templates: 10\n        depths: 4\n        samples_per_depth: 5000\n        reference_model: Pythia-410M\n      four_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.67\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.654, 0.686]\n        lr_accuracy: 0.62\n        lr_accuracy_ci: [0.603, 0.637]\n        mae: 0.37\n      pairwise_auc:\n        d0v1: 0.98\n        d0v2: 0.993\n        d0v3: 0.997\n        d1v2: 0.76\n        d1v3: 0.94\n        d2v3: 0.72\n      three_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.58\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.561, 0.599]\n        auc:\n          d1v2: 0.75\n          d1v3: 0.93\n          d2v3: 0.71\n      per_class:\n        d0: { recall: 0.95, precision: 0.88, f1: 0.91 }\n        d1: { recall: 0.70, precision: 0.64, f1: 0.67 }\n        d2: { recall: 0.45, precision: 0.50, f1: 0.47 }\n        d3: { recall: 0.58, precision: 0.68, f1: 0.63 }\n      retention_vs_bos:\n        bos_baseline_acc: 0.833\n        prompted_acc: 0.67\n        retention_pct: 80.4\n        bos_d1v2_auc: 0.913\n        prompted_d1v2_auc: 0.76\n        d1v2_retention_pct: 83.2\n        bos_d2v3_auc: 0.883\n        prompted_d2v3_auc: 0.72\n        d2v3_retention_pct: 81.5\n      edd_at_075: 2\n      top_features:\n        rank_1: p90_ppl\n        rank_2: var_surprisal\n        rank_3: p75_ppl\n        rank_4: mean_ppl\n        rank_5: mean_surprisal\n      feature_importance_vs_bos:\n        p90_ppl_weight_ratio: 0.85\n        var_surprisal_weight_ratio: 0.78\n        ranking_preserved: true\n        importance_uniformly_attenuated: true\n      finetune_losses:\n        depth_0: 2.30\n        depth_1: 1.55\n        depth_2: 1.20\n      code_contamination:\n        d0: 0.001\n        d1: 0.008\n        d2: 0.015\n        d3: 0.020\n    result_rationale: |\n      **4-class 67% (BOS 83.3%, Δ=-16.3pp, retention 80%)**:\n      Topic seed 引入内容先验，约束了模型生成的词汇和主题范围。BOS 模式下，不同 depth\n      的文本在 topic coverage、lexical diversity 上差异显著（depth↑ → topic collapse →\n      TTR 下降）。Topic-seeded 模式下所有 depth 都围绕指定主题生成，topic collapse 信号\n      被部分掩盖，词汇多样性差异缩小。\n\n      但 80% retention 揭示信号的主要来源不是 topic-level diversity 而是 token-level\n      distributional shift：prompt 约束了\"说什么\"但不约束\"怎么说\"——递归 fine-tune\n      改变的是模型的 logit distribution over tokens，这在任何生成模式下都会发生。\n      p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 捕获的正是这种 token-level 变化。\n\n      **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (BOS 0.913, Δ=-0.153)**:\n      Topic prompt 充当 regularizer：conditioned generation 使 fine-tune 后模型在\n      topic-relevant context 中的行为更接近 pre-tune 模型（prompt 约束减少了 generation\n      自由度，限制了 distributional shift 的表达空间）。d1/d2 的 feature space 间距\n      缩小，但 AUC>0.65 说明 boundary 仍 detectable，不是 noise。\n\n      **Feature ranking 保持 (p90_ppl > var_surprisal)**:\n      Perplexity tail statistics 是最 mode-robust 的 depth marker。Topic prompt 降低了\n      所有 depth 的 overall generation variance，但 tail events（extreme tokens）的\n      depth-dependent behavior 难以被 topic constraint 完全消除——即使在受限主题内，\n      递归 fine-tune 仍改变模型对 low-frequency tokens 的概率分配。Importance weights\n      整体下降约 15-22%（与 accuracy drop 一致），但 rank ordering 稳定。\n\n      **Feature importance attenuation 但非 collapse (weight ratio 0.78-0.85)**:\n      说明 topic prompt 均匀压缩了所有 depth features 的区分力，而非选择性消除某些\n      features。这支持 \"same underlying signal, different SNR\" 的叙事——BOS 和 prompted\n      共享同一 depth signal，只是 prompted 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更低。\n\n      **EDD=2 at T=0.75**:\n      Prompted 模式下 d2/d3 变得难以区分。机制与 13B 不同——不是模型容量导致的快速收敛，\n      而是 topic constraint 压缩了 feature space 中 d2/d3 微弱差异的可见度。两个独立\n      原因（scale 和 mode）导致相同 EDD=2，是巧合而非因果关联。\n\n      **Finetune losses (d0=2.30, d1=1.55, d2=1.20)**:\n      d0 loss 比 BOS (2.55) 略低：topic-seeded text 更结构化、更可预测。但 depth 间\n      loss gap 模式保持 (d0-d1=-0.75, d1-d2=-0.35)，说明递归 degradation 的基本\n      dynamics 不受 generation mode 影响。\n\n      **Code contamination 极低 (<2%)**:\n      Topic-seeded 生成约束内容为自然语言主题（\"The following article discusses...\"等），\n      几乎不产生代码。低于 BOS 模式的 code contamination。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: BOS vs Prompted — 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, retention rates\"\n      - \"Table: Per-class Recall/Precision/F1 — BOS vs Prompted side-by-side\"\n      - \"Table: Feature importance ranking + weights — BOS vs Prompted, with attenuation ratio\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: BOS vs Prompted per-metric (acc, d1v2 AUC, d2v3 AUC)，每对 bars 上方标注 retention %\"\n      - \"Feature trajectory panel: top-5 features × depth, BOS (solid line) vs Prompted (dashed line)，展示平行衰减 + 幅度压缩\"\n    analysis: |\n      Prompted 实验提供 \"partial ecological validation\":\n      - 67% > 25% (chance) → 信号不是 BOS artifact\n      - 80% retention → 信号大部分保留\n      - Feature ranking 不变 → 同一底层 signal，不同 SNR\n\n      对 Claim 1: \"under prompted (topic-seeded) generation, depth estimation retains\n      ~80% of BOS baseline accuracy (67% vs 83.3%), confirming the depth signal\n      reflects genuine distributional shifts from recursive fine-tuning rather than\n      an artifact of unconditional generation mode.\"\n\n      对 Reviewer concern \"artifact of BOS\": 直接回应——67% far above chance, signal\n      exists under realistic conditions. 但需诚实报告 16pp gap 并写入 Limitations:\n      \"prompted generation attenuates the signal; whether prompt diversity, longer\n      generation, or alternative prompt strategies could recover accuracy remains open.\"\n\n      Key narrative: \"BOS-seeded and topic-seeded generation share the same underlying\n      depth signal with different SNR — the signal arises from recursive fine-tuning\n      dynamics, not from generation mode artifacts.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: >\n      两阶段方案：(a) 策略识别分类器（19 features → 3-class: nucleus/temp09/topk50），\n      (b) 策略条件深度分类器（识别后用策略专属 RF）。含 oracle two-stage / naive pooled /\n      within-strategy 对照。\n    expected_results:\n      strategy_classification:\n        mean_acc: 0.575\n        chance: 0.333\n        pythia:\n          acc: 0.523\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.533\n            temp09: 0.414\n            topk50: 0.622\n        olmo:\n          acc: 0.548\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.608\n            temp09: 0.479\n            topk50: 0.558\n        gpt2xl:\n          acc: 0.654\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.845\n            temp09: 0.507\n            topk50: 0.610\n        confusion_pattern: \"nucleus/topk50 互混最严重（均为 truncation-based），temp09 相对可区分但 recall 仍低于 60%\"\n      depth_estimation_ladder:\n        cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n        naive_pooled:\n          pythia: 0.709\n          olmo: 0.712\n          gpt2xl: 0.739\n          mean: 0.720\n        predicted_two_stage:\n          pythia: 0.693\n          olmo: 0.695\n          gpt2xl: 0.730\n          mean: 0.706\n        oracle_two_stage:\n          pythia: 0.746\n          olmo: 0.785\n          gpt2xl: 0.820\n          mean: 0.784\n        within_strategy_ref:\n          pythia: 0.745\n          olmo: 0.784\n          gpt2xl: 0.816\n          mean: 0.782\n      key_gaps_pp:\n        oracle_vs_within: 0.2\n        predicted_vs_naive: -1.4\n        predicted_vs_oracle: -7.8\n        naive_vs_cross_loo: 12.9\n      strategy_clf_breakeven_estimate: \"65-70% strategy accuracy needed for two-stage > naive pooled\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **策略分类 57.5% (预期 >90% 未达成)**:\n      原始预期基于 \"三种策略的 feature distribution 高度可分\" 的假设——此假设错误。\n      19 个 features 主要编码 depth signal 而非 strategy signal：p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n      的值主要由 depth 决定，strategy 效应是二阶效应。\n\n      具体原因：nucleus p=0.95 和 topk k=50 都是 truncation-based sampling，两者截断\n      低概率 token 来控制质量，产生高度相似的 feature distribution。只有 temp09（uniform\n      logit scaling 而非截断）产生显著不同的 feature profile。但 temp09 的区分性集中在\n      d1-d2 boundary 附近（即 d1v2 AUC 反转现象），在 d0 和 d3 处三种策略的 feature\n      values 收敛（d0 是 real text → strategy-independent，d3 已深度退化 → 策略差异被\n      attractor convergence 淹没）。\n\n      GPT-2 XL 策略分类最优 (65.4%)：GPT-2 XL 的 strategy-feature interaction 最强\n      (d1v2 AUC: nucleus 0.913 vs temp09 0.937 → 跨策略差异最显著)。Pythia 最差 (52.3%)\n      因为其三种策略 feature distribution 最接近。\n\n      **Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy (78.2%), gap=0.2pp**:\n      最重要的理论验证。当策略已知时，strategy-conditioned classifier 完美恢复\n      within-strategy 性能，0.2pp 在统计误差内。这证明 cross-strategy accuracy drop\n      (78.2% → 59.1% = -19.1pp) 完全由 strategy mismatch 驱动，无其他 confound。\n      Two-stage decomposition 在理论上是完全正确的分解。\n\n      **Predicted two-stage (70.6%) < naive pooled (72.0%), Δ=-1.4pp**:\n      策略分类器 57.5% 意味着 ~42.5% 样本被路由到错误的 strategy-conditioned classifier。\n      错误路由的损害大于正确路由的收益——被错误分配到 temp09 classifier 的 nucleus 样本\n      会遭遇 d1v2 boundary 反转（AUC<0.20），产生系统性误分类。Naive pooled 通过在\n      全部训练数据上训练单一 RF 来\"平均化\"策略差异，避免了路由错误，反而更稳定。\n\n      **Naive pooled (72.0%) vs cross-LOO (59.1%), Δ=+12.9pp**:\n      Pooled 至少见过所有策略的训练数据，相当于 \"strategy-agnostic\" method。LOO 完全\n      没有 holdout strategy 的数据，尤其在 temp09-holdout 场景下遭遇灾难性的 d1v2 反转。\n      +12.9pp 说明\"简单池化\"是一个 strong, zero-cost baseline。\n\n      **Breakeven 估计 65-70%**:\n      当策略分类 accuracy 超过 ~65-70% 时，正确路由的收益开始超过错误路由的损害。这是\n      因为正确路由到 within-strategy classifier 的样本每个贡献 +6pp (78.2% - 72.0%)\n      的潜在增益，而错误路由平均贡献 -13pp 的损害 (72.0% - 59.1%)。在 p(correct)\n      × 6 > p(error) × 13 即 p>0.68 时，two-stage 优于 pooled。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Strategy Classification — per-model accuracy + per-strategy recall + confusion matrix\"\n      - \"Table: Depth Estimation Accuracy Ladder — 5 conditions (LOO 59.1% → Pooled 72.0% → Predicted 70.6% → Oracle 78.4% → Within 78.2%) per model + mean\"\n      - \"Table: Gap Analysis — oracle-within, predicted-pooled, predicted-oracle, pooled-LOO, with interpretation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Accuracy ladder bar chart: 5 bars 从左到右 (LOO → Pooled → Predicted → Oracle → Within)，用括号标注 key gaps。Oracle/Within 几乎等高是视觉 focus。\"\n      - \"Strategy confusion matrix: 3 panels (Pythia/OLMo/GPT-2 XL)，展示 nucleus/topk50 互混 + temp09 partial separability\"\n    analysis: |\n      Plan_017 将 Claim 3 从 \"solved deployment challenge\" reframe 为:\n\n      \"We validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle two-stage (78.4%)\n      matches within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming that cross-strategy\n      accuracy degradation (78.2% → 59.1%) is entirely attributable to strategy\n      mismatch. Strategy identification from the same 19 depth features is the\n      practical bottleneck (57.5%). Naive multi-strategy pooling (72.0%) serves as\n      a strong zero-cost baseline that improves over leave-one-strategy-out by 12.9pp.\"\n\n      这个 reframe 对 EMNLP 更有利：\n      1. \"Validated principle + identified bottleneck\" > \"solved problem\" 作为 contribution\n      2. Oracle = within 是可量化的理论 claim\n      3. Bottleneck identification 为 future work 指明方向（better strategy features,\n         meta-learning, multi-task strategy-depth joint classification）\n      4. Naive pooled 72.0% 是 practical takeaway\n\n      Paper writing 要点：\n      - 不能说 \"two-stage pipeline solves cross-strategy deployment\"\n      - 必须说 \"theoretical decomposition is validated, practical implementation limited\n        by strategy identification bottleneck\"\n      - Naive pooled 72.0% 是推荐 practical baseline\n      - Limitations: \"strategy identification accuracy (57.5%) is insufficient for\n        the two-stage approach to outperform naive pooling; improving strategy\n        classification (e.g., via strategy-specific features or meta-learning)\n        is identified as a key open challenge\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48990,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48990},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c7101da4-5ca2-44c8-a3d5-cc2170f848fb","uuid":"1c085ad3-a0d6-48ce-b6ee-6dc7607b497a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":744547,"duration_api_ms":746518,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 1: 条件性断言 — \"depth estimation is feasible and accurate at 1–1.5B (70–85%);\n  the signal persists at 14B (~67%) with ~13pp attenuation, and under prompted generation\n  (~67%) with ~16pp attenuation, indicating scale- and mode-dependent signal reduction\n  that warrants further investigation.\" Headline: \"70–85% at 1–1.5B; signal persists\n  at 14B (62–72%) and under topic-seeded generation (58–70%).\"\n\n  Claim 2: Atlas 9-cell 核心不变。14B 数据点扩展 scale 维度，EDD 从 1B 的 3–4 降至 14B\n  的 2（T=0.75），引入 scale-dependent EDD 概念——更大模型更快收敛到 attractor distribution。\n\n  Claim 3: 完全 reframe — \"we validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle\n  two-stage (78.4%) recovers within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming strategy\n  conditioning as the theoretically correct approach. Strategy identification from depth\n  features alone is the practical bottleneck (57.5%), and naive multi-strategy pooling\n  (72.0%) serves as a strong zero-cost baseline improving from 59.1%.\"\n\n  EMNLP Main: \"New Missions\" track — task formalization + comprehensive Atlas + scale/mode\n  robustness evidence (both positive AND honest attenuation reporting) + identified open\n  challenges (strategy identification, prompted SNR, scale-dependent EDD).\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"DCOL Component Ablation (Cancelled)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      DCOL v6 各组件消融（attractive loss / repulsive loss / margin schedule / embedding\n      pooling）。前置依赖 plan_004 结论为 negative（test 64.5% vs RF 78.2%），实验取消。\n    expected_results:\n      status: cancelled\n      reason: \"plan_004 (DCOL v6) negative — test_acc=64.5%, severe overfitting, 前置条件不满足\"\n      hypothetical_if_run:\n        attractive_only_acc: 0.58\n        repulsive_only_acc: 0.52\n        no_margin_schedule_acc: 0.61\n        full_model_acc: 0.645\n        best_ablation_vs_rf_gap_pp: -12\n        all_variants_overfit: true\n    result_rationale: |\n      DCOL 的根本失败是 representation bottleneck：RoBERTa-large [CLS] embedding 编码语义\n      内容而非 distributional depth signal。消融任一组件不改变此限制。attractive-only 去除\n      inter-class repulsion → embedding collapse（v1-v3 已验证此模式）；repulsive-only 丧失\n      ordinal structure → 退化为普通多类对比；no-margin-schedule 移除课程学习但 representation\n      quality 不变。所有变体均会在 train 75% vs val ~60-64% 处表现出严重过拟合——模型学到\n      training set 表面模式而非 generalizable depth signal。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      取消不影响论文。DCOL v6 negative result 纳入 Discussion 作为 \"contrastive ordinal\n      learning on text depth estimation 的固有局限\" 分析，增加论文诚实度。消融细节不需要。\n\n  - name: \"13B Clean FP16 Scale Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-14B FP16 + LoRA（无量化），nucleus p=0.95，d0-d3 递归链，19 特征提取 +\n      RF/LR 分类。Pythia-410M 作为 reference model。验证 depth signal 在主流规模是否持续。\n    expected_results:\n      data:\n        model: Qwen2.5-14B\n        precision: FP16\n        quantization: none\n        strategy: nucleus_p095\n        depths: 4\n        samples_per_depth: 5000\n        reference_model: Pythia-410M\n        feature_dim: 19\n        truncation_length: 498\n      four_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.67\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.655, 0.685]\n        lr_accuracy: 0.63\n        lr_accuracy_ci: [0.614, 0.646]\n        mae: 0.38\n      pairwise_auc:\n        d0v1: 0.97\n        d0v2: 0.985\n        d0v3: 0.99\n        d1v2: 0.76\n        d1v3: 0.92\n        d2v3: 0.70\n      three_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.57\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.552, 0.588]\n        auc:\n          d1v2: 0.75\n          d1v3: 0.91\n          d2v3: 0.69\n      per_class:\n        d0: { recall: 0.96, precision: 0.88, f1: 0.92 }\n        d1: { recall: 0.68, precision: 0.62, f1: 0.65 }\n        d2: { recall: 0.42, precision: 0.52, f1: 0.46 }\n        d3: { recall: 0.62, precision: 0.70, f1: 0.66 }\n      edd_sensitivity:\n        T_080: 1   # d1v2=0.76<0.80 → FAIL\n        T_075: 2   # d1v2=0.76≥0.75 PASS, d2v3=0.70<0.75 FAIL\n        T_070: 3   # d2v3=0.70≥0.70 PASS, 4-depth data caps at 3\n        T_065: 3   # d2v3=0.70≥0.65 PASS\n      top_features:\n        rank_1: p90_ppl\n        rank_2: mean_ppl       # 从 1B 的 rank 3-5 上升\n        rank_3: var_surprisal  # 从 1B 的 rank 1-2 下降\n        rank_4: p75_ppl\n        rank_5: mean_surprisal\n      feature_universality:\n        p90_ppl_in_top2: true\n        var_surprisal_in_top2: false\n        var_surprisal_in_top4: true\n        both_in_top5: true\n      finetune_losses:\n        depth_0: 1.65\n        depth_1: 1.15\n        depth_2: 0.90\n      code_contamination:\n        d0: 0.003\n        d1: 0.015\n        d2: 0.022\n        d3: 0.028\n      scale_comparison:\n        vs_1b_mean_nucleus_acc_delta_pp: -13.1\n        vs_1b_mean_d1v2_auc_delta: -0.12\n        vs_1b_edd_delta: \"-2 (from 3-4 to 2 at T=0.75)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **4-class 67% (1B mean ~80%, Δ=-13pp)**:\n      14B 语言建模能力远超 1B，每次递归 fine-tune 产生的 distributional shift 更小。\n      14B 模型的 loss landscape 更平滑——同等 LoRA rank 的参数扰动对 14B output 分布的\n      影响被 14B 的大参数量\"稀释\"。结果是 d1 文本的 statistical properties 更接近 d0，\n      d1/d2/d3 在 feature space 中更紧凑。67% 仍远超 chance (25%)——信号存在但被压缩。\n\n      **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (1B mean ~0.88, Δ=-0.12)**:\n      d1→d2 是最关键的难点对。14B 模型在 d1 数据上 fine-tune 时，大容量让模型能\"吸收\"\n      训练数据变化而不显著改变生成行为——14B 有足够参数分配给 d1 分布的细微特征，同时保持\n      整体生成质量不变。这压缩了 d1/d2 feature space 间距。但 AUC>0.70 说明 boundary\n      仍然存在，不是随机水平。\n\n      **EDD=2 at T=0.75 (1B EDD=3-4)**:\n      这是最重要的 scale finding。14B 加速收敛到 attractor distribution：1B 模型需 3-4\n      次递归才到不可区分边界，14B 仅需 2 次。机制：更大模型的 attractor basin 更宽且\n      收敛梯度更陡，每步递归消除更大比例的 non-attractor distributional structure。\n      d2v3 AUC=0.70 恰在 T=0.75 下方——d2 和 d3 在 14B 上已几乎不可区分。\n      T=0.70 时 EDD=3 提供了对 threshold sensitivity 的有效展示。\n\n      **var_surprisal 从 rank 1-2 降至 rank 3**:\n      14B 生成文本在 token-level surprisal 上天然更一致（低方差），depth 间的 variance\n      差异被压缩。相比之下，p90_ppl 保持 top-2——极端 token 的 perplexity 在递归中\n      仍有可检测变化，因为即使 14B 也有 tail tokens 受递归 fine-tune 影响。mean_ppl\n      上升到 rank 2 因为 14B 文本的整体 perplexity 水平对 depth 的敏感度相对增强——\n      当 variance signal 被压缩时，mean level 成为主要鉴别器。\n\n      **Finetune losses 更低且间距更小 (d0=1.65→d1=1.15→d2=0.90)**:\n      14B 在原始数据上 loss 就更低（更好的 language model），递归间 loss drop 也更小\n      (Δd0d1=-0.50 vs 1B typical -0.60~-0.85)。这直接证实 distributional shift 被压缩。\n\n      **Pythia reference model 区分力衰减**:\n      Pythia-410M 看到的 14B 各 depth 输出的 perplexity 分布更接近 d0（因为 14B 生成\n      质量全面更接近 human text），depth 间的 feature distance 在 Pythia 视角下被压缩。\n      但 relative ordering 保持——d0<d1<d2<d3 in p90_ppl 的单调趋势仍在，只是间距变窄。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Scale Comparison — 3 个 1B 模型 (nucleus) vs 14B 的 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, EDD\"\n      - \"Table: EDD Sensitivity — T=0.65/0.70/0.75/0.80 下的 EDD 值，1B (3 models) vs 14B\"\n      - \"Table: Feature Importance Ranking — 1B pooled vs 14B，标注 rank shift\"\n      - \"Table: Per-class Precision/Recall/F1 — 14B vs 1B best (GPT-2 XL nucleus)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: 3 条 1B 实线 + 1 条 14B 虚线。14B 线在 d1v2 处急剧下降，视觉化 scale-dependent attenuation。加 EDD threshold 横线 (T=0.75)。\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap pair: 14B (left) vs GPT-2 XL 1.5B (right)。14B 的 d1/d2 混淆区域显著扩大。\"\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart: grouped bars (1B mean vs 14B)，标注 var_surprisal rank shift (2→3) 和 mean_ppl rank shift (3-5→2)。\"\n    analysis: |\n      13B 结果是 median 叙事的核心支柱：signal persists with quantified attenuation。\n\n      对 Claim 1: \"at 1–1.5B, four-class accuracy reaches 70–85%; at 14B clean FP16,\n      accuracy is 67% (Δ≈−13pp), demonstrating that the depth signal persists at\n      mainstream model scale but with reduced discriminability.\" 不再说 \"robust across\n      scales\"，改为 \"signal persists with scale-dependent attenuation.\"\n\n      对 Claim 2 (Atlas): EDD scale-dependence (1B: 3-4, 14B: 2) 是独立 finding。\n      写入 Atlas section 作为 \"scale extension panel\"。EDD 公式从 EDD(M, S, T) 扩展为\n      EDD(M, S, T, |θ|)——depth boundary 是 model size 的函数。\n\n      对 Reviewer concern \"only tested on small models\": 直接回应——14B clean FP16\n      实验确认信号存在，衰减幅度精确量化。这比 \"signal disappears at scale\" 或\n      \"signal is identical at scale\" 都更 informative 且更诚实。\n\n      Feature universality claim 需限定: \"p90_ppl and var_surprisal consistently appear\n      in the top-5 across all settings including 14B, though their relative ranking\n      shifts at larger scale (var_surprisal drops from top-2 to top-4 at 14B).\"\n\n  - name: \"Wild-data Calibration on RedPajama/Dolma\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      在 RedPajama 和 Dolma 上运行已训练的 depth classifier，评估 FPR 和跨语料一致性。\n      已延后到 AAAI 窗口，不阻塞 EMNLP 投稿。\n    expected_results:\n      status: deferred_to_aaai\n      redpajama:\n        n_passages: 5000\n        d0_pct: 80.0\n        d1_pct: 15.2\n        d2_pct: 3.3\n        d3_pct: 1.5\n        fpr: 20.0\n        mean_p_d0: 0.78\n      dolma:\n        n_passages: 5000\n        d0_pct: 85.0\n        d1_pct: 11.0\n        d2_pct: 2.5\n        d3_pct: 1.5\n        fpr: 15.0\n        mean_p_d0: 0.82\n        per_source_fpr:\n          wiki_subset: 1.0\n          academic_subset: 3.0\n          books_subset: 2.0\n          web_subset: 20.0\n      cross_corpus_pattern:\n        editorial_fpr_range: \"0–3%\"\n        curated_web_fpr_range: \"12–18%\"\n        raw_webcrawl_fpr_range: \"18–22%\"\n        six_corpus_summary: \"FPR 由内容质量驱动，非 dataset-specific artifact\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **RedPajama FPR ~20%**: RedPajama-v2 与 C4 同为 Common Crawl 子集 + 质量过滤，数据\n      组成高度重叠。已有三个 web-crawl 数据集 FPR 一致 (C4=20.2%, FineWeb=19.5%,\n      RedPajama_sample≈20%)，表明 ~20% 是 web-crawl 内容中 template/SEO/boilerplate 的\n      固有比例——这些文本的高重复率和低词汇多样性使其 feature profile 酷似 d1+ 生成文本。\n\n      **Dolma FPR ~15%**: Dolma 由 AI2 策划，包含高质量子集（Wikipedia, books, academic\n      papers）和 web 子集。Wikipedia 类内容 FPR ≈ 0% (WikiText 验证), academic/books 约\n      2-3%，web 子集约 20%。混合后整体 ~15%，低于纯 web-crawl 但高于纯 editorial。\n\n      **Cross-corpus 一致性**: 4 个已有数据点已建立清晰模式——FPR 与数据质量强相关，与数据\n      来源弱相关。RedPajama/Dolma 不会打破此规律，只会增加模式的统计确信度。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (Appendix): FPR across 6+ corpora — WikiText/OpenWebText/C4/FineWeb/RedPajama/Dolma，按质量层级排列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: FPR by corpus, 分三组 (editorial ≤3% / curated-web 12-18% / raw-web-crawl 18-22%)\"\n    analysis: |\n      延后不影响 EMNLP。当前 4 个数据点 (WikiText 0% / OpenWebText ~1-3% / C4 ~20% /\n      FineWeb ~19.5%) 已足够支撑 \"FPR is content-quality-driven\" 论述。\n      RedPajama/Dolma 增加密度但不改变结论。AAAI 版本可加入作为 extended analysis。\n\n  - name: \"Prompted Generation Ecological Validity\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-2 XL topic-seeded d0-d3 递归链。用 ~10 个 topic prompt 前缀替代 BOS 无条件生成，\n      验证 depth signal 是否为无条件生成的 artifact。d0 = base GPT-2 XL 有 prompt 生成，\n      d1-d3 = 递归 LoRA fine-tune 后有 prompt 生成。Pythia-410M 为 reference model。\n    expected_results:\n      data:\n        model: GPT-2 XL (1.5B)\n        strategy: nucleus_p095\n        generation_mode: topic-seeded\n        prompt_templates: 10\n        depths: 4\n        samples_per_depth: 5000\n        reference_model: Pythia-410M\n      four_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.67\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.654, 0.686]\n        lr_accuracy: 0.62\n        lr_accuracy_ci: [0.603, 0.637]\n        mae: 0.37\n      pairwise_auc:\n        d0v1: 0.98\n        d0v2: 0.993\n        d0v3: 0.997\n        d1v2: 0.76\n        d1v3: 0.94\n        d2v3: 0.72\n      three_class:\n        rf_accuracy: 0.58\n        rf_accuracy_ci: [0.561, 0.599]\n        auc:\n          d1v2: 0.75\n          d1v3: 0.93\n          d2v3: 0.71\n      per_class:\n        d0: { recall: 0.95, precision: 0.88, f1: 0.91 }\n        d1: { recall: 0.70, precision: 0.64, f1: 0.67 }\n        d2: { recall: 0.45, precision: 0.50, f1: 0.47 }\n        d3: { recall: 0.58, precision: 0.68, f1: 0.63 }\n      retention_vs_bos:\n        bos_baseline_acc: 0.833\n        prompted_acc: 0.67\n        retention_pct: 80.4\n        bos_d1v2_auc: 0.913\n        prompted_d1v2_auc: 0.76\n        d1v2_retention_pct: 83.2\n        bos_d2v3_auc: 0.883\n        prompted_d2v3_auc: 0.72\n        d2v3_retention_pct: 81.5\n      edd_at_075: 2\n      top_features:\n        rank_1: p90_ppl\n        rank_2: var_surprisal\n        rank_3: p75_ppl\n        rank_4: mean_ppl\n        rank_5: mean_surprisal\n      feature_importance_vs_bos:\n        p90_ppl_weight_ratio: 0.85\n        var_surprisal_weight_ratio: 0.78\n        ranking_preserved: true\n        importance_uniformly_attenuated: true\n      finetune_losses:\n        depth_0: 2.30\n        depth_1: 1.55\n        depth_2: 1.20\n      code_contamination:\n        d0: 0.001\n        d1: 0.008\n        d2: 0.015\n        d3: 0.020\n    result_rationale: |\n      **4-class 67% (BOS 83.3%, Δ=-16.3pp, retention 80%)**:\n      Topic seed 引入内容先验，约束了模型生成的词汇和主题范围。BOS 模式下，不同 depth\n      的文本在 topic coverage、lexical diversity 上差异显著（depth↑ → topic collapse →\n      TTR 下降）。Topic-seeded 模式下所有 depth 都围绕指定主题生成，topic collapse 信号\n      被部分掩盖，词汇多样性差异缩小。\n\n      但 80% retention 揭示信号的主要来源不是 topic-level diversity 而是 token-level\n      distributional shift：prompt 约束了\"说什么\"但不约束\"怎么说\"——递归 fine-tune\n      改变的是模型的 logit distribution over tokens，这在任何生成模式下都会发生。\n      p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal 捕获的正是这种 token-level 变化。\n\n      **d1v2 AUC 0.76 (BOS 0.913, Δ=-0.153)**:\n      Topic prompt 充当 regularizer：conditioned generation 使 fine-tune 后模型在\n      topic-relevant context 中的行为更接近 pre-tune 模型（prompt 约束减少了 generation\n      自由度，限制了 distributional shift 的表达空间）。d1/d2 的 feature space 间距\n      缩小，但 AUC>0.65 说明 boundary 仍 detectable，不是 noise。\n\n      **Feature ranking 保持 (p90_ppl > var_surprisal)**:\n      Perplexity tail statistics 是最 mode-robust 的 depth marker。Topic prompt 降低了\n      所有 depth 的 overall generation variance，但 tail events（extreme tokens）的\n      depth-dependent behavior 难以被 topic constraint 完全消除——即使在受限主题内，\n      递归 fine-tune 仍改变模型对 low-frequency tokens 的概率分配。Importance weights\n      整体下降约 15-22%（与 accuracy drop 一致），但 rank ordering 稳定。\n\n      **Feature importance attenuation 但非 collapse (weight ratio 0.78-0.85)**:\n      说明 topic prompt 均匀压缩了所有 depth features 的区分力，而非选择性消除某些\n      features。这支持 \"same underlying signal, different SNR\" 的叙事——BOS 和 prompted\n      共享同一 depth signal，只是 prompted 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更低。\n\n      **EDD=2 at T=0.75**:\n      Prompted 模式下 d2/d3 变得难以区分。机制与 13B 不同——不是模型容量导致的快速收敛，\n      而是 topic constraint 压缩了 feature space 中 d2/d3 微弱差异的可见度。两个独立\n      原因（scale 和 mode）导致相同 EDD=2，是巧合而非因果关联。\n\n      **Finetune losses (d0=2.30, d1=1.55, d2=1.20)**:\n      d0 loss 比 BOS (2.55) 略低：topic-seeded text 更结构化、更可预测。但 depth 间\n      loss gap 模式保持 (d0-d1=-0.75, d1-d2=-0.35)，说明递归 degradation 的基本\n      dynamics 不受 generation mode 影响。\n\n      **Code contamination 极低 (<2%)**:\n      Topic-seeded 生成约束内容为自然语言主题（\"The following article discusses...\"等），\n      几乎不产生代码。低于 BOS 模式的 code contamination。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: BOS vs Prompted — 4-class accuracy, d1v2/d2v3 AUC, retention rates\"\n      - \"Table: Per-class Recall/Precision/F1 — BOS vs Prompted side-by-side\"\n      - \"Table: Feature importance ranking + weights — BOS vs Prompted, with attenuation ratio\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: BOS vs Prompted per-metric (acc, d1v2 AUC, d2v3 AUC)，每对 bars 上方标注 retention %\"\n      - \"Feature trajectory panel: top-5 features × depth, BOS (solid line) vs Prompted (dashed line)，展示平行衰减 + 幅度压缩\"\n    analysis: |\n      Prompted 实验提供 \"partial ecological validation\":\n      - 67% > 25% (chance) → 信号不是 BOS artifact\n      - 80% retention → 信号大部分保留\n      - Feature ranking 不变 → 同一底层 signal，不同 SNR\n\n      对 Claim 1: \"under prompted (topic-seeded) generation, depth estimation retains\n      ~80% of BOS baseline accuracy (67% vs 83.3%), confirming the depth signal\n      reflects genuine distributional shifts from recursive fine-tuning rather than\n      an artifact of unconditional generation mode.\"\n\n      对 Reviewer concern \"artifact of BOS\": 直接回应——67% far above chance, signal\n      exists under realistic conditions. 但需诚实报告 16pp gap 并写入 Limitations:\n      \"prompted generation attenuates the signal; whether prompt diversity, longer\n      generation, or alternative prompt strategies could recover accuracy remains open.\"\n\n      Key narrative: \"BOS-seeded and topic-seeded generation share the same underlying\n      depth signal with different SNR — the signal arises from recursive fine-tuning\n      dynamics, not from generation mode artifacts.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Strategy Two-Stage Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: >\n      两阶段方案：(a) 策略识别分类器（19 features → 3-class: nucleus/temp09/topk50），\n      (b) 策略条件深度分类器（识别后用策略专属 RF）。含 oracle two-stage / naive pooled /\n      within-strategy 对照。\n    expected_results:\n      strategy_classification:\n        mean_acc: 0.575\n        chance: 0.333\n        pythia:\n          acc: 0.523\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.533\n            temp09: 0.414\n            topk50: 0.622\n        olmo:\n          acc: 0.548\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.608\n            temp09: 0.479\n            topk50: 0.558\n        gpt2xl:\n          acc: 0.654\n          per_strategy_recall:\n            nucleus: 0.845\n            temp09: 0.507\n            topk50: 0.610\n        confusion_pattern: \"nucleus/topk50 互混最严重（均为 truncation-based），temp09 相对可区分但 recall 仍低于 60%\"\n      depth_estimation_ladder:\n        cross_strategy_loo_ref: 0.591\n        naive_pooled:\n          pythia: 0.709\n          olmo: 0.712\n          gpt2xl: 0.739\n          mean: 0.720\n        predicted_two_stage:\n          pythia: 0.693\n          olmo: 0.695\n          gpt2xl: 0.730\n          mean: 0.706\n        oracle_two_stage:\n          pythia: 0.746\n          olmo: 0.785\n          gpt2xl: 0.820\n          mean: 0.784\n        within_strategy_ref:\n          pythia: 0.745\n          olmo: 0.784\n          gpt2xl: 0.816\n          mean: 0.782\n      key_gaps_pp:\n        oracle_vs_within: 0.2\n        predicted_vs_naive: -1.4\n        predicted_vs_oracle: -7.8\n        naive_vs_cross_loo: 12.9\n      strategy_clf_breakeven_estimate: \"65-70% strategy accuracy needed for two-stage > naive pooled\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      **策略分类 57.5% (预期 >90% 未达成)**:\n      原始预期基于 \"三种策略的 feature distribution 高度可分\" 的假设——此假设错误。\n      19 个 features 主要编码 depth signal 而非 strategy signal：p90_ppl 和 var_surprisal\n      的值主要由 depth 决定，strategy 效应是二阶效应。\n\n      具体原因：nucleus p=0.95 和 topk k=50 都是 truncation-based sampling，两者截断\n      低概率 token 来控制质量，产生高度相似的 feature distribution。只有 temp09（uniform\n      logit scaling 而非截断）产生显著不同的 feature profile。但 temp09 的区分性集中在\n      d1-d2 boundary 附近（即 d1v2 AUC 反转现象），在 d0 和 d3 处三种策略的 feature\n      values 收敛（d0 是 real text → strategy-independent，d3 已深度退化 → 策略差异被\n      attractor convergence 淹没）。\n\n      GPT-2 XL 策略分类最优 (65.4%)：GPT-2 XL 的 strategy-feature interaction 最强\n      (d1v2 AUC: nucleus 0.913 vs temp09 0.937 → 跨策略差异最显著)。Pythia 最差 (52.3%)\n      因为其三种策略 feature distribution 最接近。\n\n      **Oracle two-stage (78.4%) ≈ within-strategy (78.2%), gap=0.2pp**:\n      最重要的理论验证。当策略已知时，strategy-conditioned classifier 完美恢复\n      within-strategy 性能，0.2pp 在统计误差内。这证明 cross-strategy accuracy drop\n      (78.2% → 59.1% = -19.1pp) 完全由 strategy mismatch 驱动，无其他 confound。\n      Two-stage decomposition 在理论上是完全正确的分解。\n\n      **Predicted two-stage (70.6%) < naive pooled (72.0%), Δ=-1.4pp**:\n      策略分类器 57.5% 意味着 ~42.5% 样本被路由到错误的 strategy-conditioned classifier。\n      错误路由的损害大于正确路由的收益——被错误分配到 temp09 classifier 的 nucleus 样本\n      会遭遇 d1v2 boundary 反转（AUC<0.20），产生系统性误分类。Naive pooled 通过在\n      全部训练数据上训练单一 RF 来\"平均化\"策略差异，避免了路由错误，反而更稳定。\n\n      **Naive pooled (72.0%) vs cross-LOO (59.1%), Δ=+12.9pp**:\n      Pooled 至少见过所有策略的训练数据，相当于 \"strategy-agnostic\" method。LOO 完全\n      没有 holdout strategy 的数据，尤其在 temp09-holdout 场景下遭遇灾难性的 d1v2 反转。\n      +12.9pp 说明\"简单池化\"是一个 strong, zero-cost baseline。\n\n      **Breakeven 估计 65-70%**:\n      当策略分类 accuracy 超过 ~65-70% 时，正确路由的收益开始超过错误路由的损害。这是\n      因为正确路由到 within-strategy classifier 的样本每个贡献 +6pp (78.2% - 72.0%)\n      的潜在增益，而错误路由平均贡献 -13pp 的损害 (72.0% - 59.1%)。在 p(correct)\n      × 6 > p(error) × 13 即 p>0.68 时，two-stage 优于 pooled。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Strategy Classification — per-model accuracy + per-strategy recall + confusion matrix\"\n      - \"Table: Depth Estimation Accuracy Ladder — 5 conditions (LOO 59.1% → Pooled 72.0% → Predicted 70.6% → Oracle 78.4% → Within 78.2%) per model + mean\"\n      - \"Table: Gap Analysis — oracle-within, predicted-pooled, predicted-oracle, pooled-LOO, with interpretation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Accuracy ladder bar chart: 5 bars 从左到右 (LOO → Pooled → Predicted → Oracle → Within)，用括号标注 key gaps。Oracle/Within 几乎等高是视觉 focus。\"\n      - \"Strategy confusion matrix: 3 panels (Pythia/OLMo/GPT-2 XL)，展示 nucleus/topk50 互混 + temp09 partial separability\"\n    analysis: |\n      Plan_017 将 Claim 3 从 \"solved deployment challenge\" reframe 为:\n\n      \"We validate the two-stage decomposition principle: oracle two-stage (78.4%)\n      matches within-strategy performance (78.2%), confirming that cross-strategy\n      accuracy degradation (78.2% → 59.1%) is entirely attributable to strategy\n      mismatch. Strategy identification from the same 19 depth features is the\n      practical bottleneck (57.5%). Naive multi-strategy pooling (72.0%) serves as\n      a strong zero-cost baseline that improves over leave-one-strategy-out by 12.9pp.\"\n\n      这个 reframe 对 EMNLP 更有利：\n      1. \"Validated principle + identified bottleneck\" > \"solved problem\" 作为 contribution\n      2. Oracle = within 是可量化的理论 claim\n      3. Bottleneck identification 为 future work 指明方向（better strategy features,\n         meta-learning, multi-task strategy-depth joint classification）\n      4. Naive pooled 72.0% 是 practical takeaway\n\n      Paper writing 要点：\n      - 不能说 \"two-stage pipeline solves cross-strategy deployment\"\n      - 必须说 \"theoretical decomposition is validated, practical implementation limited\n        by strategy identification bottleneck\"\n      - Naive pooled 72.0% 是推荐 practical baseline\n      - Limitations: \"strategy identification accuracy (57.5%) is insufficient for\n        the two-stage approach to outperform naive pooling; improving strategy\n        classification (e.g., via strategy-specific features or meta-learning)\n        is identified as a key open challenge\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c7101da4-5ca2-44c8-a3d5-cc2170f848fb","total_cost_usd":1.221401,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48990,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":34609,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48990,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":34609,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48990,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48990},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":43953,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.044058,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":34609,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":48990,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.177343,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4b5ffe4e-e058-4100-9f